# ── OS / editor cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp

# ── Python ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/

# ⚠ NOT inherited on purpose: upstream carries a blanket `__init__.py`
# ignore with `!src/**/__init__.py` negations. Its own .gitignore records
# that blanket rule as a REAL DEFECT — `src/<domain>/__init__.py` IS the
# domain's public API surface (L4 ST-3), so a fresh clone imported a
# namespace package with none of it. We do not inherit a known defect.

# ── Secrets — never commit ─────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
deploy/*.service
!deploy/*.service.example

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  ⚠ ARRIVES AT MS-8 (absorption) — these paths do not exist yet.
#  Listed NOW so the copy cannot commit them. Same logic as PG-8:
#  keeping this file a SUPERSET of upstream's makes the absorption a
#  merge rather than a reconciliation.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Generated / runtime state — re-derivable, never a source of truth
.state/
data/
logs/
debug/
test/
trained_models/
catboost_info/

# Model artifacts
*.pkl
*.model
*.joblib

# ⚠⚠ REAL BROKER TRANSACTION DATA — the sharpest item in this file.
# Upstream ignores it; if this rule does not travel with the sdd/ copy
# at MS-8, real BMO transaction CSVs land in history permanently.
sdd/design/rel6_design/samples/bmo_investorline_transactions/

# reports/ is ignored EXCEPT the archived Release-5 experiment evidence.
# ⚠ This block must stay LAST: gitignore cannot re-include below an
# ignored DIRECTORY (hence the /* layering), and the trailing negations
# must out-rank the generic logs/ and *.pkl patterns above — last match wins.
reports/*
!reports/experiments/
reports/experiments/*
!reports/experiments/Rel5_Experiment/
!reports/experiments/Rel5_Experiment/**
